{
  "id": 2999,
  "title": "设置训练循环",
  "meta_title": "设置大语言模型微调训练循环",
  "meta_description": "配置全参数微调训练过程所需的组成部分，包括优化器和调度器。",
  "content": "<p>微调 (fine-tuning)大型语言模型的目标是利用特定任务数据更新我们预训练 (pre-training)模型的所有参数 (parameter) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>。训练循环是此过程的运行核心。此循环根据在微调数据集上计算得到的损失函数 (loss function)提供的反馈，指导模型权重 (weight)的迭代调整。</p>\n<p>构建一个有效的训练循环需要若干相互关联的组成部分，每个部分都在引导模型在目标任务上取得更好表现方面发挥着不同作用。</p>\n<h3>微调 (fine-tuning)循环的核心组成部分</h3>\n<p>典型的全参数 (parameter)微调循环遵循标准的监督学习 (supervised learning)模式，并适用于大型模型。以下是每次迭代中执行的重要步骤分解：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据加载：</strong> 从上一章准备的微调数据集中获取一批数据（输入提示/文本及相应的目标输出）。这通常由数据加载器处理，它负责数据的洗牌、批处理以及可能的数据整理（在批次内将序列填充到相同长度）。</li>\n<li><strong>前向传播：</strong> 将输入批次通过大语言模型 (LLM)。模型处理输入标记 (token)并为序列中的每个位置生成原始输出分数，这些分数通常被称为 logits。\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Logits</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>模型</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>输入批次</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Logits} = \\text{模型}(\\text{输入批次}, \\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Logits</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模型</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入批次</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li><strong>损失计算：</strong> 计算损失，它量化 (quantization)了模型预测的 logits 与数据集中实际目标输出之间的差异。对于语言建模或序列生成任务，交叉熵损失是标准做法。它衡量模型预测序列中下一个标记的准确程度。\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>损失函数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Logits</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>目标批次</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\text{损失函数}(\\text{Logits}, \\text{目标批次})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">损失函数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Logits</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标批次</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li><strong>反向传播 (backpropagation)：</strong> 计算损失函数 (loss function)相对于<em>所有</em>可训练模型参数（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>）的梯度。此梯度 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_{\\theta} L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span> 指示每个参数为减少损失所需改变的方向和幅度。此步骤计算量大，因为它涉及将误差信号反向传播通过整个网络架构。\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>计算梯度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_{\\theta} L = \\text{计算梯度}(L, \\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计算梯度</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化器步骤：</strong> 使用优化算法更新模型的参数。优化器<strong>使用</strong>计算得到的梯度（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_{\\theta} L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span>）和学习率（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span>）来调整权重 (weight)，以期最小化损失。AdamW（Adam 加权衰减）是训练 Transformer 模型的常用优化器，以其有效性和稳定性而闻名。\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>优化器更新</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\leftarrow \\theta - \\eta \\cdot \\text{优化器更新}(\\nabla_{\\theta} L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">优化器更新</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li><strong>梯度清零：</strong> 在开始下一次迭代之前，重置模型参数中存储的梯度。这是必要的，因为在大多数深度学习 (deep learning)框架中，梯度计算默认是累积的。未能清零梯度将导致基于先前批次累积梯度的不正确更新。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这些步骤会重复指定的轮数（遍历整个数据集）或迭代次数，逐步调整模型参数以更好地适应微调数据。</p>\n<h3>结构</h3>\n<p>尽管具体实现方式因所选框架（如 PyTorch、TensorFlow 或 Hugging Face <code>Trainer</code> 等更高级别的库）而异，但基本结构保持一致。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\"># 训练循环结构（使用类似 PyTorch 的语法）\n\nmodel = load_pretrained_llm(...)\ntokenizer = load_tokenizer(...)\ndataset = load_finetuning_dataset(...)\ndataloader = DataLoader(dataset, batch_size=...)\noptimizer = AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=learning_rate)\n# 可选：学习率调度器\n# scheduler = get_linear_schedule_with_warmup(...)\n\nmodel.train() # 将模型设置为训练模式\n\nfor epoch in range(num_epochs):\n    for batch in dataloader:\n        # 1. 准备输入（移至适当设备，例如 GPU）\n        inputs = prepare_batch(batch, tokenizer, device)\n        targets = inputs[\"labels\"] # 假设标签已准备好\n\n        # 2. 前向传播\n        outputs = model(**inputs)\n        logits = outputs.logits\n\n        # 3. 损失计算\n        loss = compute_loss(logits, targets) # 例如，交叉熵损失\n\n        # 4. 反向传播\n        loss.backward() # 计算所有参数的梯度\n\n        # 5. 优化器步骤\n        optimizer.step() # 更新参数：theta = theta - lr * grad\n\n        # 可选：调度器步骤\n        # scheduler.step()\n\n        # 6. 梯度清零\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n\n        # 日志记录、评估、检查点保存（稍后讨论）\n        log_metrics(loss)\n\n    # 可选：在每个 epoch 结束时评估\n    evaluate_model(model, eval_dataloader)\n    # 保存检查点\n    save_checkpoint(model, optimizer, epoch)\n\n</code></pre>\n<h3>管理设备放置</h3>\n<p>大语言模型 (LLM)体量庞大，而全参数 (parameter)微调 (fine-tuning)需要大量的计算能力，通常是 GPU 或 TPU。请确保您的模型和数据批次在每次迭代开始时都明确地移至目标计算设备（例如 PyTorch 中的 <code>.to(device)</code>），以便<strong>使用</strong>硬件加速。</p>\n<h3>重要配置</h3>\n<p>设置此循环也涉及配置控制训练过程的参数 (parameter)：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>学习率（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span>）：</strong> 决定参数更新期间的步长。选择合适的学习率非常重要；过高可能导致不稳定，而过低则可能导致收敛缓慢。通常，与预训练 (pre-training)相比，微调 (fine-tuning)时使用较小的学习率（例如 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1e-5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5e-5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>批次大小：</strong> 每次迭代中处理的样本数量。较大的批次大小可以提供更稳定的梯度估计，但需要更多内存。</li>\n<li><strong>轮数：</strong> 整个数据集被处理的次数。轮数过少可能导致欠拟合 (underfitting)，而过多则可能导致过拟合 (overfitting)。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些设置与模型表现之间的相互关系很复杂，构成了超参数 (hyperparameter)调整的根据，我们将在下一节进行讨论。</p>\n<h3>训练循环流程示意</h3>\n<p>训练循环表示一个由数据驱动的计算和参数 (parameter)更新循环。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-1ky2o29\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph TrainingLoop {\n    rankdir=LR;\n    node [shape=box, style=\"rounded,filled\", fontname=\"Arial\", margin=0.2];\n    edge [fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=10];\n\n    DataLoader [label=\"数据批次\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n    Model [label=\"大语言模型 (参数 θ)\", fillcolor=\"#bac8ff\"];\n    Logits [label=\"预测值 (Logits)\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"];\n    LossFn [label=\"损失函数\", fillcolor=\"#eebefa\"];\n    LossVal [label=\"损失值 (L)\", fillcolor=\"#fcc2d7\", shape=ellipse];\n    Backward [label=\"反向传播\\n(计算 ∇θ L)\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"];\n    Optimizer [label=\"优化器步骤\\n(更新 θ)\", fillcolor=\"#ffd8a8\"];\n    ZeroGrad [label=\"梯度清零\", fillcolor=\"#ffec99\"];\n\n    DataLoader -> Model [label=\"输入\"];\n    Model -> Logits [label=\"前向传播\"];\n    Logits -> LossFn;\n    DataLoader -> LossFn [label=\"目标\"];\n    LossFn -> LossVal;\n    LossVal -> Backward;\n    Backward -> Optimizer [label=\"梯度 ∇θ L\"];\n    Optimizer -> Model [label=\"更新参数 θ\"];\n    Optimizer -> ZeroGrad [style=dashed];\n    ZeroGrad -> DataLoader [label=\"下一批次\", style=dashed];\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-1ky2o29\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>流程图示意了微调 (fine-tuning)训练循环单次迭代中的核心步骤。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>理解并正确实现此训练循环是成功适配大语言模型 (LLM)的根本所在。尽管库可以抽象掉一些细节，但了解其底层机制有助于更好地进行调试、优化和定制微调过程。后续部分将在此根据上继续讲解，讨论超参数 (hyperparameter)选择、正则化 (regularization)以及全参数微调特有的资源管理。</p>",
